# 📦 Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/Machine-Learning-From-Scratch-30-Days.git
```

Move into the repository:

```bash
cd Machine-Learning-From-Scratch-30-Days
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

